<view class="page selection-page">
  <view wx:if="{{previewMode}}" class="preview-tag">页面预览</view>
  <view class="step-track"><text>01 选择身份</text><view class="step-line"></view><text class="current">02 找到班级</text></view>
  <text class="eyebrow">每一个人，都有所归属</text>
  <text class="page-title">找到你的班级</text>
  <text class="page-description">学校、年级、班级，连接你与校园的日常。</text>
  <view class="selection-card card">
    <view class="selection-field"><view><text class="field-number">01</text><text>选择学校</text></view><t-icon name="chevron-down" size="30rpx" /></view>
    <view class="selection-field"><view><text class="field-number">02</text><text>选择年级</text></view><t-icon name="chevron-down" size="30rpx" /></view>
    <view class="selection-field"><view><text class="field-number">03</text><text>选择班级</text></view><t-icon name="chevron-down" size="30rpx" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">班级选择即将开放，暂时无法保存。开通后，你可以在这里依次选择学校、年级和班级。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="connection-message">{{errorMessage}}</view>
  <view class="action-stack"><t-button theme="default" variant="outline" size="large" block loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bind:tap="onRetry">刷新连接状态</t-button></view>
</view>
